#, fuzzy, kde-format
#| msgid ""
#| "<qt><p>This section allows you to add your own GUI  Elements "
#| "('<i>Widgets</i>') to store your own values into %1. Proceed as described "
#| "below:</p><ol><li>Click on '<i>Edit with Qt Designer</i>'<li>In the "
